{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37365","headline":"金陵怀古 · 唐彦谦","name":"金陵怀古","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"碧树凉生宿雨收，荷花荷叶满汀洲。\n登高有酒浑忘醉，慨古无言独倚楼。\n宫殿六朝遗古迹，衣冠千古漫荒丘。\n太平时节殊风景，山自青青水自流。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"唐彦谦","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_37365.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37365","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}